# ProgramCreator — Cursor Rules (v3 FINAL)

## Business
- Brand: ProgramCreator — agency arm of a personal brand. One-person studio. Personal, direct, signed.
- Founder: Daive (@daivescales). First person singular always ("I build", never "we deliver").
- Service: Creator Product Scaling.
- Lane A (creators/digital): product + converting page, scaled via their socials. PAYMENT: revenue split, zero upfront.
- Lane B (physical brands): storefront rebuild + social→site. PAYMENT: monthly retainer.
- Same discipline both lanes; payment model is the only structural difference. Say it plainly.
- Audience: inbound from socials, creators/founders 22–35 who can spot templates.

## Voice
Short declarative sentences. Specific beats clever. Understatement = confidence.
Banned: unlock, elevate, empower, synergy, revolutionize, seamless, cutting-edge, game-changer, "in today's landscape", "we're passionate about", "take it to the next level", "let's build something amazing".
No exclamation marks. No emoji in UI.

## Layout — "THE DOSSIER" (anti-template)
BANNED: 3-col icon cards, bento grids, decorative pill badges, centred hero+sub+2 CTAs, floating shadow cards, generic "Our Services/Process/Why Us" titles, gradient text/buttons/borders, emoji/3D blobs.

USE INSTEAD:
- THE SPINE: lg+ 12-col grid; cols 1–2 = sticky rail (section number + vertical uppercase label); cols 3–12 = content. Mobile: rail becomes horizontal row above content.
- Rules not boxes: 1px edge-to-edge hairlines + whitespace. Contained = hairline top/bottom, not rounded bordered cards.
- Radius 0 everywhere (optional 0–2px on primary CTA only if tested and consistent).
- Type is the design. Oversized display headings carry sections.
- Tabular thinking: indexes, lists, real comparison tables — not feature cards.
- Asymmetry: left-weighted against the spine. Only Final CTA is centred.
- Signed: Daive signature (SVG path draw) in About strip + Footer.

## Colour (exact)
--pc-navy-900 #071528 · --pc-navy-800 #0B2038 (page) · --pc-navy-700 #102C4C · --pc-navy-600 #16395F
--pc-line rgba(255,255,255,0.09) · --pc-line-2 rgba(255,255,255,0.18)
--pc-white #FFF · --pc-text #C2D4E8 · --pc-muted #94AAC4 (AA-safe)
--pc-accent #4D9BFF · --pc-accent-2 #A9CDFF · --pc-glow rgba(77,155,255,0.28)
Accent only on: CTAs, section numbers, 1–2 emphasis words/screen, active states. Max ~4 accent elements per screen.

## Type
Inter Tight 400/500/600/700 — structural; headings tracking-[-0.035em].
Instrument Serif italic 400 — emphasis words in --pc-accent-2 + signature. ~4 uses/page. Never body/buttons/labels.
display clamp(2.75rem,8vw,7rem) leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.04em]
h2 clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem) · h3 clamp(1.15rem,1.9vw,1.5rem) · body 17px leading-[1.6] max-w-[60ch]
label 11px uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pc-muted

## Motion doctrine — CRITICAL
HARD BANS — do not install or implement:
✗ Lenis / Locomotive / any scroll-hijack · ✗ GSAP / ScrollTrigger · ✗ scroll-pin / sticky-stack · ✗ scroll-scrub · ✗ parallax · ✗ custom cursor · ✗ scramble/glitch/typewriter/char-shuffle · ✗ animating width/height/top/left/margin/padding

SCROLL may ONLY fire one-shot whileInView reveals: viewport={{ once: true, margin: "-12%" }}. Never re-run, reverse, or track progress (except ScrollProgress bar scaleX).

ALL OTHER MOTION = ambient (idle CSS loops, hover, state). GPU-cheap; keeps page alive without scroll cost.

Perf: transform + opacity ONLY. will-change while active then clear. Idle loops CSS when possible. ≤~6 idle loops on screen. Native 60fps scroll.
Ease in: cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) · out: cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)
Durations: micro 160ms · standard 500ms · display 850ms.

Primitives (src/components/motion/): MaskText, MaskLines, Reveal, RuleDraw, StaggerList, CountUp, Marquee, RotatingWord, SignalLines, PulseDot, LiveMock, MagneticButton (≤6px), IndexRow.
Reduced motion: 0.15s opacity fades, loops freeze, magnetic off. Text in DOM without JS.

## Texture
Grain 3.5% sitewide (mandatory). One glow bloom hero + one Final CTA (26s CSS drift, barely visible). Nothing else.

## Funnel
Routes: / · /apply (10 steps) · /book · /privacy · /terms
Landing = 9 blocks only: Hero, Ticker, Model, Lanes, Process, Proof, AboutStrip, FAQ, FinalCTA. ~5–6 screens.
Every CTA → /apply. Labels: "Apply to work with me" / "How it works".
/apply → Supabase + Sheet + Resend → /book.

## Tech
Next 15 App Router, TS strict, Tailwind, Framer Motion only for motion, lucide-react.
Server Components default; motion as leaf clients.
Config in site-config.ts. No lorem. No stock people photos. 375/768/1440.
A11y: landmarks, focus-visible --pc-accent, AA, labelled inputs.
Intentional TODOs only: results data, Daive photo, legal jurisdiction, analytics cookies section.
